<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= pageTitle %> - Blogger AI</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #1a202c;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 30px;
            background-color: #2d3748;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        h1 { color: #f6ad55; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 1.9rem; }
        h2 { color: #4299e1; font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 28px; }
        .subtitle { color: #a0aec0; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px; }
        .message { margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 5px;
                   background-color: #742a2a; color: #feb2b2; border: 1px solid #9b2c2c; }
        .status-box {
            background-color: #1a202c;
            border: 1px solid #4a5568;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .status-box p { margin: 4px 0; }
        .label { color: #a0aec0; font-weight: bold; }
        code, .uri {
            font-family: 'SFMono-Regular', Consolas, monospace;
            background-color: #1a202c;
            border: 1px solid #4a5568;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            word-break: break-all;
            color: #9ae6b4;
        }
        .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: bold; }
        .badge.ok { background-color: #22543d; color: #9ae6b4; }
        .badge.bad { background-color: #742a2a; color: #feb2b2; }
        ol li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
        a.button {
            display: inline-block; margin-top: 24px; padding: 10px 18px;
            background-color: #4299e1; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;
        }
        a.button:hover { background-color: #3182ce; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
    <h1><%= pageTitle %></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Google rejected the sign-in request before the consent screen could load.</p>

    <div class="message"><%= message %></div>

    <h2>Current configuration</h2>
    <div class="status-box">
        <p><span class="label">GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID:</span>
            <span class="badge <%= status.clientIdSet ? 'ok' : 'bad' %>"><%= status.clientIdSet ? 'set' : 'missing' %></span></p>
        <p><span class="label">GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET:</span>
            <span class="badge <%= status.clientSecretSet ? 'ok' : 'bad' %>"><%= status.clientSecretSet ? 'set' : 'missing' %></span></p>
        <p><span class="label">GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL:</span>
            <span class="badge <%= status.callbackUrlEnvSet ? 'ok' : 'bad' %>"><%= status.callbackUrlEnvSet ? 'set' : 'missing' %></span></p>
        <p><span class="label">Redirect URI in use:</span>
            <span class="uri"><%= status.redirectUri || '(could not be resolved — this is what causes "Missing required parameter: redirect_uri")' %></span></p>
        <p><span class="label">Resolved from:</span> <%= status.redirectUriSource %></p>
    </div>

    <h2>How to fix it</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Open <strong>Google Cloud Console → APIs &amp; Services → Credentials</strong> and edit your
            <em>OAuth 2.0 Client ID</em> (type: <strong>Web application</strong>).</li>
        <li>Under <strong>Authorised redirect URIs</strong>, add exactly:<br>
            <span class="uri"><%= suggestedRedirectUri %></span></li>
        <li>In your hosting dashboard (Render → Environment), set:<br>
            <code>GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID</code>, <code>GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET</code> and
            <code>GOOGLE_CALLBACK_URL=<%= suggestedRedirectUri %></code></li>
        <li>Save and redeploy, then try <a href="/auth/login">signing in</a> again.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="subtitle">Tip: the URI must match character for character — same scheme (https), no trailing slash,
        no query string. Machine-readable status is available at <code>/auth/status</code>.</p>

    <a class="button" href="/admin">← Back to dashboard</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
